{"title":"gitlab_sec","url":"https://about.gitlab.com/blog/categories/security/","favicon":"https://about.gitlab.com/images/ico/favicon.ico","elements":[{"title":"GitLab discovers widespread npm supply chain attack","contents":"<div class=\"image\" data-v-d630f833=\"\"><img data-nuxt-img=\"\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,c_lfill/v1749665667/Blog/Hero%20Images/built-in-security.jpg 1x, https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,c_lfill/v1749665667/Blog/Hero%20Images/built-in-security.jpg 2x\" onerror=\"this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)\" fetch-priority=\"high\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,c_lfill/v1749665667/Blog/Hero%20Images/built-in-security.jpg\" data-v-d630f833=\"\"></div><div class=\"text\" data-v-d630f833=\"\"><h4 class=\"slp-text-heading4-bold\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-d630f833=\"\"><!--[-->GitLab discovers widespread npm supply chain attack<!--]--><!----></h4><h5 class=\"slp-text-heading5\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-d630f833=\"\"><!--[-->Malware driving attack includes \"dead man's switch\" that can harm user data.<!--]--><!----></h5><span class=\"slp-text-body3-bold author\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-d630f833=\"\"><!--[-->Authors: Michael Henriksen, Daniel Abeles<!--]--><!----></span><a class=\"cta slp-btn slp-btn-primary cta\" data-ga-name=\"gitlab discovers widespread npm supply chain attack\" data-ga-location=\"body\" href=\"/blog/gitlab-discovers-widespread-npm-supply-chain-attack/\" data-v-c6fd7cb9=\"\" data-v-d630f833=\"\"><!--[-->Read Post<!--]--></a></div>","link":"https://about.gitlab.com/blog/gitlab-discovers-widespread-npm-supply-chain-attack/","retrieved":1764672387831},{"title":"Migrate from pipeline variables to pipeline inputs for better security","contents":"<a href=\"/blog/categories/security/\" data-ga-name=\"security\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-4d3fff66=\"\"><span class=\"slp-text-body1\" dat